  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "三种 EngineType",
      "items": [
        "NORMAL:prompt + decode 混跑,单机/未分离部署",
        "PROMPT:只做 prefill(PE);COMPLETION:只做 decode(CE)",
        "COMPLETION 无 prefill 通道,启动即硬拦截 TORCH_CHECK(engine_type != COMPLETION || stop_preempted_request)",
        "两处枚举必须一致:engine_type.py 与 scheduler.hpp:39–43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "跨 C++/Python 边界的纪律",
      "items": [
        "C++ 持对象池,Python 拿 ObjectPoolPyObject<SequenceMetadata> 包装",
        "clone_states/clone_blocks/zero_states 是内部 vector 的 const 引用,下一次 schedule 前必须消费完",
        "请求输出走 uint64 指针数组(np.ndarray),由 RequestOutputPool 池化"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "进程模型与释放时机",
      "items": [
        "slave worker set_pdeathsig(SIGKILL) 后阻塞在 cp_broadcast_object:父进程死则子进程被内核 SIGKILL,不留僵尸",
        "DeferredRelease 让释放动作与 GPU 计算 overlap,且调用方下一 step 前还能读",
        "所以「step() 返回的 RequestOutput 下一步自动失效」,要留存必须 pool.clone"
      ]
    }
  ]
